# Fintech Platform Monorepo

A Kubernetes-native micro-service backend exposing REST APIs for banking, insurance, ledger, and dashboard components.

- [Getting Started](#getting-started)
- [Architecture Quick-Look](#architecture-quick-look)
- [Local Development](#local-development)

## Getting Started
Read [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md) for local setup instructions.

## Architecture Quick-Look
- **Edge Layer:** Kong Gateway (`infra`) - OIDC, rate-limiting, metrics
- **Auth Layer:** Keycloak (`auth` namespace)
- **Services:**
  - `services/go-bank` - Banking APIs (`/api/v1/accounts`, `/api/v1/transfers` ...)
  - `services/go-insur` - Insurance APIs
  - `services/go-ledger` - Internal ledger service
  - `services/go-dash` - Admin dashboard operations
- **Data:** PostgreSQL multi-tenant (column `tenant_id INT`), Hyperledger Fabric
- **Observability:** Prometheus / Grafana, ELK stack (stdout -> Fluent Bit -> Logstash -> Elastic)

## Local Development
Prerequisites:
- Docker & Docker Compose ≥ v2
- kubectl, helm3
- Pre-commit hooks: install via `pre-commit install`

